      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Substantial three bed semi-detached residence on a very generous site, in this most convenient and sought after residential area on the south side of Cork City.\r\n\r\nSpacious room size offering good living accommodation is a feature of this property. Large enclosed south facing garden to rear with secure off street & on site parking to front elevation for 3 / 4 number vehicles.\r\n\r\nConvenient to all local amenities including shopping, schools, local sports clubs and on public transport route.\r\nThis property will make an excellent purchase for some person or persons.\r\n\r\nGuide price; €345,000\r\nBER Pending\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: - Note the above particulars are confidential and are given on the strict understanding that all negotiations shall be conducted through this firm.  Every care has been taken in their preparation, but we do not hold ourselves responsible for any inaccuracies.  All reasonable offers will be submitted to the owners for consideration"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Front Porch 17’2’ x 4’;\r\n4 Lights.\r\n\r\nReception Hall 12’ x 5’9’;\r\nTile floor.\r\n1 Power Point. 1 Light. 1 Radiator.\r\n\r\nLiving Room 13’3’ x 11’9’; \r\nFireplace. Solid wood floor. Spacious living room.\r\n4 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. Double Radiator.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room 20’2’ x 10’3’;\r\nSliding door to conservatory. Tile floor. \r\nBuilt in wall & floor kitchen units, cooker hob, integrated appliances, double oven & hob.\r\n8 Power Points. 1 Window. 2 Lights. Double Radiator.\r\n\r\nConservatory 17’5’ x 12’3’;\r\nPatio door. Wood laminate floor.\r\nLarge bright area with south facing aspect.\r\n4 Power Points. 1 Window. 2 Lights.\r\n\r\nBathroom 13’3’ x 8’10’;\r\nLarge bathroom. Fully tiled walls & floor.\r\nFour piece white suite to include corner bath & jacuzzi shower cubicle.\r\n1 Light. 1 Window. Double Radiator.\r\n\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLanding Area;\r\nStairs to attic.\r\n1 Power Point. 1 Light. 1 Window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 14’2’ x 8’2’;\r\nBuilt in robes.\r\n2 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. Double Radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 11’ x 8’2’;\r\nBuilt in robes.\r\n2 Power Points. 2 Windows. 1 Light. Double Radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 8’9’ x 8’2’;\r\n2 Power Points. 1 Window. 1 Light. Double Radiator.\r\n\r\nBathroom 8’2’ x 6’2’;\r\n1 Light. 1 Window. Double Radiator.\r\n\r\nRear Garden;\r\n\r\nFuel Shed 10’ x 6’;\r\n1 Light.\r\n\r\nExternal Barna Shed 11’ x 9’;\r\n2 Power Points. 1 Light.\r\n\r\nSteel Tech Shed 7’ x 9’"
